<title>FRANCE: French household confidence improves in December.</title>
<headline>French household confidence improves in December.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>INSEE gave the following data on Thursday on household opinions. A positive figure shows the percentage points by which the percentage of respondents saying things had improved or risen outnumbered the percentage saying things had worsened.</p>
<p>				     Dec   Nov   Oct  Sep Jul Jun May</p>
<p> Overall consumer sentiment  -33   -34   -34  -36 -35 -36 -37</p>
<p> Past living standards	 -66   -69   -71  -73 -73 -72 -71</p>
<p> Future living standards     -38   -39   -39  -44 -43 -43 -44</p>
<p> Future unemployment	    54    66    70   76  76  59  67</p>
<p> Past inflation		  -53   -53   -51  -54 -47 -42 -41</p>
<p> Future inflation		-37   -33   -36  -37 -44 -40 -35</p>
<p> Good time to spend	    -25   -29   -31  -34 -32 -32 -30</p>
<p> Good time to save		51    54    54   53  50  56  49</p>
<p> Current personal finances     9     9     6    9   9  10   7</p>
<p> Past personal finances	-21   -22   -23  -23 -23 -25 -25</p>
<p> Future personal finances     -8    -8    -8  -10 -10 -10 -13</p>
<p> Ability to save		 -29   -27   -29  -31 -30 -29 -31</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5381</p>
